{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8000_situation", "source_sha256": "a0a1bb6f840175ee0b9acf1afd084216c74a36e77a4657b8f85eb03761f935e9", "ja": "グラビア撮影のお仕事　休憩中", "zh": "写真拍摄工作　休息中", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8000_place", "source_sha256": "d06f29f4ba7ec3bd67ac0359e94c2a131813275b930237b20eaceec7e0410703", "ja": "闇の大病院", "zh": "暗黑大医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8001_p", "source_sha256": "da78f1b26c58afc2419bd03f6c17aa22b7b096582da7f59993f3ca2d94f4b65a", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影。\n『闇の病院で働くナース』がテーマなのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的拍摄。\n主题虽然是“在黑暗医院工作的护士”，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8002_018ele", "source_sha256": "0d40d1a564087a73aea4fadc30f4dcca64bbe24dfd24c9b898c22a5437ceac59", "ja": "闇でナース……もしかして、オバ……\nダメダメ、今のナシ！　はあ、難しいヨ～……！", "zh": "黑暗中的护士……难道是大妈……不不不，刚才那句不算！唉，好难啊～……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8003_p", "source_sha256": "d1cef78df4278fd11c4c4225eced314a610f2c5fb6989a8ac1f66b085c570b51", "ja": "お疲れ様。どうしたんだ、エレナ？", "zh": "辛苦了。怎么了，艾蕾娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8004_018ele", "source_sha256": "06486363b64c2460152a2f3e61f89795fe73641d51f458d08fdf7188c3e0e103", "ja": "{$P$}……。あのね、スタッフさんに\n「自由にやっていいよ」って言われたノ。", "zh": "{$P$}……那个，工作人员对我说“可以自由发挥”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8005_018ele", "source_sha256": "78cb516a154ba225509ab8ed2d8431475f44f5f2d118bd7f7d8b8659e1482e10", "ja": "だから、『闇ナース』について考えてたんだケド。\n全然イメージがまとまらないんだヨ～！", "zh": "所以，我一直在想“黑暗护士”的事，可是完全整理不出头绪来呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8006_018ele", "source_sha256": "877cf31ecb40395ecea5daea1469986e59fee9a200a4637415ff7d1d1adceda2", "ja": "暗～い雰囲気を出すのがいいのカナって思ったり、\nでもナースさんは優しくて明るいイメージだし……。", "zh": "我在想是不是应该营造出一种阴暗～的氛围，\n但护士给人的印象又是温柔开朗的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8007_p", "source_sha256": "c9e89784484acfd96909b65afd2fc7432f4328cf0f217e04a23759118a52d285", "ja": "見事に両極端だな……。", "zh": "两个极端啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8008_018ele", "source_sha256": "aecce6138b0e607d40544d5b6c0e2d239d1963c55b212a51cb0cbb1853630147", "ja": "でしょ？　{$P$}は、\nどうするのが一番いいと思う？", "zh": "对吧？{$P$}觉得怎么做最好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8009", "source_sha256": "815c0bd7a00dfb335af230d4de4dc3cf88febdb3b12c8e8c212fa4adf9e85151", "ja": "明るく", "zh": "明亮地", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8010", "source_sha256": "a5d25212a156004118fe7c56dc4f1b9128d985206a0681035fa50b36db30cba8", "ja": "暗く", "zh": "暗", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8011", "source_sha256": "3cea95b13bbee129becbfaedb25063137cfb1e4820b67209a76c450463d9b667", "ja": "両方", "zh": "两者", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8100_p", "source_sha256": "3eb09902eff9873f2d09f23d77dfb74a98ef2539c52152d0c2da2d27a39888e5", "ja": "明るく、かな。イメージに正解はない。\nなら、一番エレナが輝く形がいいんじゃないかな？", "zh": "明快一些吧。毕竟，形象没有所谓的正确答案。  \n既然这样，选择最能让艾蕾娜闪耀的风格，不是更好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8101_018ele", "source_sha256": "bf5f829a66260e45730b18d00e80120e360493c7a032c3fbfac34bd1545e1651", "ja": "ワタシが輝く……そっか！　それなら、\n元気いっぱいな方が、みんなに喜んでもらえるよネ♪", "zh": "能让自己闪耀……这样啊！那样的话，还是活力满满的样子更能让大家开心吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8102_018ele", "source_sha256": "07d6cec8b1ab53aa0c41ddb3b5ad62ae661bf212ce0a4e7225b037d9c911880e", "ja": "ウン、決めた！　ワタシにしか出来ない、明るい\n『闇ナース』で、ステキな写真を撮ってもらうヨ～♪", "zh": "嗯，决定了！我要用只有我才能做到的开朗\n“暗黑护士”造型，请大家帮我拍出漂亮的照片哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8200_p", "source_sha256": "d89ce961cb5a5eb276fc1297a5892654eec7e0a9967ef1a2466081b3b9e3ccdf", "ja": "暗く、かな。なかなか無いテーマだし、\n新しいエレナの魅力を見せられるチャンスだと思う。", "zh": "偏暗的风格吗。这个主题还挺少见的，\n我觉得这是展现新的艾莲娜魅力的好机会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8201_018ele", "source_sha256": "b9c20aed605bbeb4800e4044f02dfc31db89711e5221d292f0e9afdcabadfef1", "ja": "確かに……。暗い感じって、ワタシと反対だもんね。\nでも、それが出来たら、イイ写真になる気がするヨ～！", "zh": "确实……。阴暗的感觉，和我完全相反呢。\n不过，要是能做到的话，感觉会是一张很棒的照片哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8202_018ele", "source_sha256": "d1e8eb0a8b1174d75ac3ed007ea0bb010cc4c9b3da166214c2703c3d60878065", "ja": "ワタシ、思い切って挑戦してみる！\nアドバイスありがとネ、{$P$}！", "zh": "我会鼓起勇气挑战一下！\n谢谢你的建议，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8300_p", "source_sha256": "11d3f5aec41782b87b3ba0ca8dfcf6165d9cc168110dedac687567d348d56b12", "ja": "あえて、両方意識するのはどうだ？\nどちらも大事なポイントだと思うんだ。", "zh": "不如试着同时兼顾两方面？\n我觉得两者都是很重要的要点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8301_018ele", "source_sha256": "c9bf17ded32ac464fb470a87260efe1f03cefa47c73e9e69b3f0a47bf6d47fdc", "ja": "えっと……暗くて、明るいナースさんってこと？\n{$P$}が言うなら、試してみるケド。", "zh": "嗯……也就是说，要当一个既阴沉又开朗的护士小姐？  \n既然是{$P$}说的，我就试试看吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_018ele_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_018ele_8302_018ele", "source_sha256": "6901bc2460f1e6171c6a566f8e2736b9ea6764ca1c1a17b7441921c538389dda", "ja": "うう、頭がグルグルしてきたヨ……。\nウマくいかなかったら、また相談するネ。", "zh": "呜呜，脑袋开始晕乎乎的了……\n要是不顺利的话，我再来找你商量哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
